                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "So Many Bugs...\n\nI love the idea and I'm a huge fan of the series that it gains its inspiration, but this game is NOT finished. It's barely alpha-equivalent, if that. There are typos (even on the main menu!), graphical issues, and it seems to just be a mobile port (right click does not cancel buildings etc). It also wants to sync to Google Play. The balance is bad as well. I had one enemy rocket turret kill two tanks in two shots. Not only will it two-shot a tank, but the collisions are so broken that the tanks were stacked and both took damage at the same time. \n\nAs for originality, there is very little in my opinion. Units are directly named after units in C&C games (MCV, Predator tank, etc) and some of the buildings are nearly identical. The logos are direct rips from the Red Alert franchise with minor tweaks to keep the lawyers away. \n\nI rarely write reviews and even more rarely bad ones, but stay away from this one.",
